<div class="meeting-summary-content">
<h1>Climate Change and Sustainability Committee </h1>
  September 23, 2026 10:00 AM
  
  <p>City Council Chamber</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Roll Call </strong><br/>
	 </li>
<li value="2"><strong>Approval of the Minutes</strong><br/>
	August 26, 2026, Climate Change and Sustainability Committee<br/>
	 </li>
<li value="3"><strong>Resolution – Distributed Energy Resource Program – UD-24-02</strong><br/>
	The committee will consider a resolution to approve Phase 3 Battery Energy Storage System Distributed Energy Resource Pilot Program.<br/>
	 </li>
<li value="4"><strong>Presentation – Lafitte Greenway Improvements</strong><br/>
	The Lafitte Greenway Partnership will present on the Lafitte Greenway improvements and status of completion of the final half-mile tract.<br/>
	 </li>
<li value="5"><strong>Motion - West End Drainage Project</strong><br/>
	The committee will consider a motion to enter into a Professional Services Agreement to provide professional design, engineering, and construction management services for the West End Drainage Modular Tank System project.<br/>
	 </li>
<li value="6"><strong>Adjournment</strong></li>
</ol>
